meson: accept solaris_console_owner_file on illumos

Meson's host_machine.system() is "sunos" on illumos and Solaris
(https://mesonbuild.com/Reference-tables.html#operating-system-names), so
the check for "solaris" rejects the option everywhere it is meant for, and
at_console policies can never match there. Accept "sunos" as well.

Backport of upstream 14917abf
(https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/dbus/dbus/-/commit/14917abf), which is not in
the 1.16.x branch; drop it with the move to dbus 1.17/1.18.

--- dbus-1.16.2/meson.build
+++ dbus-1.16.2/meson.build
@@ -532,7 +532,7 @@
 have_console_owner_file = false
 console_owner_file = get_option('solaris_console_owner_file')
 if console_owner_file != ''
-  if not host_os.contains('solaris')
+  if not (host_os.contains('solaris') or host_os == 'sunos')
     error('solaris_console_owner_file is only supported on Solaris)')
   endif
   have_console_owner_file = true
